sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant DB as SmartPot-DB (TimescaleDB)
  participant T as SmartPot-Trainer (Python)
  participant AI as SmartPot-AI (Rust Engine)

  T->>DB: ADBC Connection with smartpot_reader credentials
  T->>DB: Query SELECT * FROM trainer_readings WHERE measured_at >= NOW() - INTERVAL 30 days
  DB-->>T: PyArrow RecordBatches (Zero-Copy Arrow format)
  T->>T: Polars Feature Engineering & Imputation
  T->>T: Train candidate models (DecisionTree, MLP, Ridge)
  T->>T: Evaluate cross-validation scores against baseline
  alt Model Failed Validation
    Note over T: Discard candidate and keep previous active model
  else Model Validated & Verified
    T->>T: Serialize model to clean JSON AST (no pickle)
    T->>T: Sign model JSON with Ed25519 private key & compute BLAKE2b hash
    T->>AI: POST /v1/models/reload (Bearer Token + JSON Payload)
    AI->>AI: Verify Ed25519 signature & AST schema
    AI->>AI: Atomic ArcSwap pointer update
    AI-->>T: 200 OK {"status":"reloaded"}
  end
